# Trivy suppressions for the SBOM vulnerability gate (//Documentation:release_sbom_scan).
#
# Add one CVE id per line to stop it failing the build. Every entry MUST have a
# comment stating the category and reason. Review the list on every release.
#
# Two categories are allowed:
#
#   1. No upstream fix yet - the dependency has no patched release, so a bump
#      cannot help. Temporary; remove and bump the day a fix ships. Include a
#      tracking link.
#
#   2. Not reachable - the vulnerable code path is not used by Gerrit (VEX
#      "not affected"). Include the justification.
#
# The list is intentionally empty: all CVEs flagged so far have fixes and are
# remediated by dependency bumps rather than suppressed.
